    "rationale": "Each perturbation targets a source-verified HumMod pulmonary parameter. Ventilation and inspired-gas controls are held identical across baseline and injury cases. The expanded one-shot sweep includes small dose-response families so a single Windows execution can test monotonicity as well as direction. Values remain exploratory engineering probes, not clinically calibrated ARDS settings.",
